+# Set the due-by of a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim directly (a steward only). The due-by stays as set: a holiday added later does not move it; its overdue, late charge, grace and period follow it. A refused set (not a steward, not DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING, a claim due in a closed period or a new due-by inside one) writes nothing, not even an audit line.
